Z||000001||Black88GT||03-06-2001||12:43 PM||||1984 Coupe - 2.5 4 cyl. 4 speed - 17.7 @ 75.2 mph (Motor Trend 9/83) 18.2 @ 72.5 mph (Car and Driver 9/83)    <P>1985 GT - 2.8 V6 4 speed - 16.2 @ 84.2 mph (Motor Trend 11/84)  16.0 @ 85.0 mph (Car and Driver 11/84)<P>1986 GT - 2.8 V6 4 speed - 15.9 @ 85.0 mph (Car and Driver 2/86) No Motor Trend QTR. mile listed but 0-60 is 8.4<P>1987 - Can't find any test data<P>1988 GT - 2.8 V6 5 speed - 16.4 @ 81.9 mph (Motor Trend 3/88)<BR>1988 Formula - 2.8 V6 5 speed - 16.0 at 85.5 mph (Road and Track 10/87) 16.1 @ 82.0 mph (Car and Driver 4/88) <P>This is about around the area for stock V6 Fiero's, high 15s at best, mid 16s worst.||||reg||1
